# The build context of the scoring service image, and only of it: the other
# images build from their own directory (./airflow, ./dashboard, ./producer,
# ./mlflow) and never read this file.
#
# AN ALLOWLIST, NOT A DENYLIST. Everything is excluded, then what the image
# needs is named. A file added to the repository later -- .env first among
# them -- stays out until somebody names it; a denylist would let it in until
# somebody remembered to exclude it. B4-EC29: no secret in a published image.
#
# The last matching line wins: "*" excludes, each "!" re-admits, and the two
# final lines take the compiled leftovers back out of what was re-admitted.
* 
!scoring_service/app.py
!scoring_service/requirements.txt
!ml4fd/
!sql/
!governance.yml
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
